  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "In this tutorial, you'll fill out the 2D room with furniture that the player can push around, and then fill it with collectibles for the player to search for. At the end, you\u2019ll even add a simple user interface that tracks the number of collectibles remaining, which will make it feel like a fun puzzle game. \n\nWhen you\u2019re ready to get started, go to the next step."
